Now, we add these two new equations:
\[ (9a - 3b + 7c) + (-7a - 11b + 9c) = 11 + (-3) \]
\[ 2a - 14b + 16c = 8 \]

We can simplify this equation by recognizing that:
\[ \boxed{8} \]
