- S: Straight line
- T: Straight line
- U: Straight line
- V: Straight line
- W: Straight line
- X: Straight line
- Y: Straight line
- Z: Straight line

The letters that can be portions of the graph of a function are those that can be represented by straight lines. Therefore, the letters are:

\(\boxed{ABCDFGHJKLMNPQRSTUVXYZ}\)
